00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:38,800
 the x axis and an extrusive pull in the y axis.

88
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:44,960
 So that maxillary first molar is experiencing both a mesial and an extrusive force.

89
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:47,560
 So the answer here is B.

